 "equipment_type": "Zoning system coordinator",
 "applies_to": "Verasys VZC100 zone coordinators that run a zoned rooftop system (zone voting, duct pressure and discharge air resets).",
 "summary": "The VZC100 coordinates a Verasys zoning system: it collects heating and cooling requests from the zones and resets the rooftop unit's discharge air and duct static pressure. Through the SBH it exposes 30 objects: changeover and reset settings, setpoints, enable and mode commands, request counts and the zoning system state.",
